{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23717","headline":"绣妇叹 · 白居易","name":"绣妇叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连枝花样绣罗襦，本拟新年饷小姑。\n自觉逢春饶怅望，谁能每日趂功夫。\n针头不解愁眉结，线缕难穿泪脸珠。\n虽凭绣牀都不绣，同牀绣伴得知无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}